  ## Contrarian Hooks (Hooks That Challenge Conventional Wisdom)
  
  Contrarian Hooks grab attention by making a bold or unexpected statement that goes against conventional advice or popular belief.
  
  They work because humans are naturally curious and want to see why common assumptions might be wrong, driving clicks, watch time, and engagement.
  
