  ## Authority Hooks (Hooks That Position You as the Expert Instantly)
  
  Authority hooks position you as an experienced, credible source by referencing your expertise, results, or unique method.
  
  They work because credibility reduces friction. When viewers believe you’ve done it before, they’re more likely to listen, trust, and act.
  
  ### Authority Hooks Work Extremely Well For:
  
  - LinkedIn micro-articles
  - Reels
  - TikTok videos
